<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>登录 - <%= brand %></title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a73e8 0%, #6c5ce7 100%); }
    .login-box { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 40px 36px; width: 360px; max-width: 92vw;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
    .login-box .logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px; color:#111; }
    .login-box .logo svg { width:42px; height:42px; fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.8; }
    .login-box h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 20px; color: #222; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .login-box .sub { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #999; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .form-group input { width: 100%; padding: 11px 12px; border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px; outline: none; transition: border .2s; }
    .form-group input:focus { border-color: #1a73e8; }
    .btn-login { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: #1a73e8; color: #fff; border: none;
      border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 4px; }
    .btn-login:hover { opacity: .9; }
    .error { background: #fdecea; color: #c62828; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; }
    .tip { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8; }
    .reg-link { margin-top: 14px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; }
    .reg-link a { color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="login-box">
    <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3.5 12.5 12 4h6.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 20 5.5V12l-8.5 8.5a2 2 0 0 1-2.8 0l-5.2-5.2a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.8Z"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r="1.2"/></svg></div>
    <h1><%= brand %></h1>
    <div class="sub">请登录后使用</div>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <form method="POST" action="/login">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>账号</label>
        <input type="text" name="username" autofocus autocomplete="username" placeholder="请输入账号">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>密码</label>
        <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="请输入密码">
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-login">登 录</button>
    </form>
    <div class="reg-link"><a href="/register">有邀请码？注册账号 →</a></div>
    <div class="reg-link" style="margin-top:8px;"><a href="/v">消费者溯源查询入口 →</a></div>
    <div class="tip">消费者扫码验证无需登录<br>合作工厂/代理商凭总部邀请码注册</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
